        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13351.txt",
        "text_sha256": "675641e1f43f170b717f58e23a1e27287a89b497371187a1d9a483810be049fb",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2004-08-12/pdf/04-18575.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Section 1. Establishment of Emergency Board (‘‘Board’’). There is established, \neffective August 10, 2004, a Board of three members to be appointed by \nthe President to investigate and report on this dispute. No member shall \nbe pecuniarily or otherwise interested in any organization of railroad employ-\nees or any carrier. The Board shall perform its functions subject to the \navailability of funds."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2654,
      "char_start": 2300,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13351#sec2",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 2.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13351#sec2",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "69 FR 50047, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "12a360b2214a7ecd37fae6418b0cdbe16b6791f2ef779aa155b824adfc05e527",
        "signing_date": "2004-08-09",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13351.txt",
        "text_sha256": "675641e1f43f170b717f58e23a1e27287a89b497371187a1d9a483810be049fb",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2004-08-12/pdf/04-18575.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. Report. Within 30 days after the creation of the Board, the parties \nto the dispute shall submit to the Board final offers for settlement of the \ndispute. Within 30 days after the submission of final offers for settlement \nof the dispute, the Board shall submit a report to the President setting \nforth its selection of the most reasonable offer."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 3006,
      "char_start": 2656,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13351#sec3",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 3.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13351#sec3",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "69 FR 50047, PDF pages 1-2",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "12a360b2214a7ecd37fae6418b0cdbe16b6791f2ef779aa155b824adfc05e527",
        "signing_date": "2004-08-09",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13351.txt",
        "text_sha256": "675641e1f43f170b717f58e23a1e27287a89b497371187a1d9a483810be049fb",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2004-08-12/pdf/04-18575.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 3. Maintaining Conditions. As provided by section 9A(h) of the Act, \nfrom the time a request to establish a second emergency board is made \nuntil 60 days after the Board submits its report to the President, the parties \nto the controversy shall make no change in the conditions out of which \nthe dispute arose except by agreement of the parties."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 3461,
      "char_start": 3008,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13351#sec4",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 4.",
